Package: devos-audio
Version: 1.0.4
Architecture: all
Maintainer: DevOS <security@devos.local>
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Depends: alsa-utils, pulseaudio-utils, pipewire, pipewire-pulse, pipewire-alsa, wireplumber
Recommends: pavucontrol
Description: Audio diagnostics and repair for DevOS
 devos-audio reports the sound cards, kernel modules, firmware, PipeWire
 nodes and mixer state, plays a test tone and applies safe repairs
 (audio group, unmute, audio stack restart, default sink repair from
 dummy/dead to the real sink). Includes a session guard unit that keeps
 the default sink pointed at real hardware, and a "DevOS Audio" launcher
 for the app grid.
